  "notes": [
    "The Repeater uses its earlier dry footsteps again. Its mouth clicks and original hunt scream are preserved. No new Suno downloads.",
    "The Reaver uses six single-impact edits of the supplied massive-footstep recording, at its original pitch. A diffuse dark room return replaces discrete duplicate footstep echoes.",
    "Completing an objective makes every hunter scream loudly with reduced distance falloff while retaining its real position, stereo direction and hall echo. Normal hunt and ambient calls retain their existing range.",
    "Station props now fit their reserved width and depth as well as height, with matching colliders. Cable drums sit fully in their bays; floor puddles stay clear of walls.",
    "Saved objective rotation and 50% quieter player footsteps are preserved. Windows 10/11 x64: close the game, then choose Check for updates and Update & restart."
  ],
